        <item>
            <title>0.15.69</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 12:34:47 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>230</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.69</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Recording an in-person meeting no longer shows the false &quot;Other side not recorded&quot; warning. That warning is about losing the other side of a call; it now appears only when a call is actually happening (Bluetooth route or a call app using the microphone), never when you are just recording the room.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
